  {
    "id": "school-board",
    "start": "a",
    "nodes": {
      "a": {
        "speaker": "Chalk on the board",
        "text": "Lesson for whoever comes late. What would you keep, if keeping it cost someone else? Do not write your answer on my board. I could not write mine.",
        "next": "b"
      },
      "b": {
        "speaker": "Chalk on the board",
        "text": "Under the words, a small river is drawn.",
        "effects": {
          "setFlag": "found-school-clue",
          "exp": 9
        }
      }
    },
    "location": "schoolhouse",
    "condition": {
      "notFlag": "found-school-clue"
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "seeker-letter",
    "start": "a",
    "nodes": {
      "a": {
        "speaker": "A letter",
        "text": "You said no. Nobody here taught you that. I can teach you only how to look. What you do with it, I will not be there to see.",
        "next": "b"
      },
      "b": {
        "speaker": "A letter",
        "text": "At the bottom, a small river is drawn.",
        "effects": {
          "setFlag": "read-seeker-letter"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "keeper-first",
    "npc": "keeper",
    "condition": {
      "notFlag": "met-keeper"
    },
    "start": "a",
    "nodes": {
      "a": {
        "speaker": "The Keeper",
        "text": "Oh. A guest.",
        "next": "b"
      },
      "b": {
        "speaker": "The Keeper",
        "text": "Come in. The kettle is still warm. It always is.",
        "next": "c"
      },
      "c": {
        "speaker": "The Keeper",
        "text": "I keep the house for the people who live here. They will be back.",
        "choices": [
          {
            "text": "Who lives here?",
            "next": "d"
          },
          {
            "text": "It's a good house.",
            "liked": true,
            "next": "e"
          },
          {
            "text": "There's no one left.",
            "next": "f"
          }
        ]
      },
      "d": {
        "speaker": "The Keeper",
        "text": "Everyone. Each chair has someone.",
        "next": "g"
      },
      "e": {
        "speaker": "The Keeper",
        "text": "It is. I sweep it every morning.",
        "next": "g"
      },
      "f": {
        "speaker": "The Keeper",
        "text": "Still. Someone might come.",
        "next": "g"
      },
      "g": {
        "speaker": "The Keeper",
        "text": "Rest here when you are tired. The bed is made.",
        "effects": {
          "setFlag": "met-keeper",
          "firstTalk": true
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "keeper-master",
    "npc": "keeper",
    "condition": {
      "flag": "tower-named-master",
      "notFlag": "keeper-denied-master"
    },
    "start": "a",
    "nodes": {
      "a": {
        "speaker": "The Keeper",
        "text": "Master? No. There is no master here.",
        "next": "b"
      },
      "b": {
        "speaker": "The Keeper",
        "text": "I only keep the house.",
        "effects": {
          "setFlag": "keeper-denied-master",
          "exp": 9
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "keeper-chair",
    "npc": "keeper",
    "condition": {
      "flag": "met-keeper",
      "notFlag": "asked-chair"
    },
    "start": "a",
    "nodes": {
      "a": {
        "speaker": "The Keeper",
        "text": "That chair? Leave it, please.",
        "next": "b"
      },
      "b": {
        "speaker": "The Keeper",
        "text": "Someone asked me to keep it ready. A long time ago.",
        "choices": [
          {
            "text": "Ready for whom?",
            "next": "c"
          },
          {
            "text": "I won't sit there.",
            "liked": true,
            "next": "d"
          }
        ]
      },
      "c": {
        "speaker": "The Keeper",
        "text": "For when they come back. That is all he said.",
        "next": "e"
      },
      "d": {
        "speaker": "The Keeper",
        "text": "Thank you. Most people want the best seat.",
        "next": "e"
      },
      "e": {
        "speaker": "The Keeper",
        "text": "Sit anywhere else. The kettle is warm.",
        "effects": {
          "setFlag": "asked-chair"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "keeper-tidy",
    "npc": "keeper",
    "condition": {
      "flag": "met-keeper",
      "notFlag": "offered-tidy"
    },
    "start": "a",
    "nodes": {
      "a": {
        "speaker": "The Keeper",
        "text": "The wind has been at the fields again. Straw everywhere.",
        "next": "b"
      },
      "b": {
        "speaker": "The Keeper",
        "text": "The Remnants out there shed it. If you find loose straw, bring it.",
        "next": "c"
      },
      "c": {
        "speaker": "The Keeper",
        "text": "Five bundles would do.",
        "effects": {
          "setFlag": "offered-tidy"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "keeper-belongings",
    "npc": "keeper",
    "condition": {
      "flag": "offered-tidy",
      "notFlag": "offered-belongings"
    },
    "start": "a",
    "nodes": {
      "a": {
        "speaker": "The Keeper",
        "text": "Things get left where they shouldn't be.",
        "next": "b"
      },
      "b": {
        "speaker": "The Keeper",
        "text": "A toy by the river. Glasses on the school steps. A knife out in the fields.",
        "next": "c"
      },
      "c": {
        "speaker": "The Keeper",
        "text": "Each one belongs to a house on the row. Put them back, would you?",
        "effects": {
          "setFlag": "offered-belongings"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "keeper-tidy-done",
    "npc": "keeper",
    "condition": {
